424
00:24:35,724 --> 00:24:37,559
They're gonna laugh at us.
They're all gonna laugh at us.

425
00:24:38,143 --> 00:24:40,353
-[emcee] Go ahead, Tom.
-[Tom] Fuck you, alright?

