430
00:24:53,992 --> 00:24:55,202
when the song ends?" You know?

431
00:24:55,285 --> 00:24:57,078
"Is he gonna know
the chorus is comin' up?"

432
00:24:57,162 --> 00:24:59,080
<i>♪ We all know conspiracies are dumb ♪</i>

433
00:24:59,164 --> 00:25:02,000
<i>♪♪</i>

434
00:25:02,083 --> 00:25:03,877
[Mark] <i>It really felt special,</i>

435
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:07,881
