444
00:25:35,033 --> 00:25:38,662
<i>♪ And there's something very wrong ♪</i>

445
00:25:38,745 --> 00:25:40,830
<i>♪ And I know it must... ♪</i>

446
00:25:40,914 --> 00:25:43,416
[Bill] <i>I remember a conversation</i>
<i>we had on our back porch.</i>

447
00:25:44,501 --> 00:25:46,378
He had a hard decision to make.

448
00:25:47,045 --> 00:25:50,632
<i>♪ I'm not like you guys ♪</i>

449
00:25:51,007 --> 00:25:54,261
<i>♪ Twelve majestic lies ♪</i>

450
00:25:54,844 --> 00:25:56,763
Hey, thanks a lot, man. I appreciate that.

451
00:25:56,846 --> 00:25:58,431
That was fucking great.

452
00:25:58,515 --> 00:26:00,141
[cheering and applause]

453
00:26:02,269 --> 00:26:04,396
[Travis]
<i>I was havin' a hard time with the decision</i>

454
00:26:04,479 --> 00:26:05,855
<i>'cause I felt really bad.</i>

455
00:26:06,356 --> 00:26:10,193
<i>I'd been with the band for two years,</i>
<i>and I loved playing with The Aquabats.</i>

456
00:26:11,820 --> 00:26:14,739
