<i>that no one ever knows</i>

457
00:26:14,823 --> 00:26:17,534
<i>because they just didn't catch</i>
<i>a particular break.</i>

458
00:26:18,743 --> 00:26:20,537
I told Travis to do it.

459
00:26:21,079 --> 00:26:24,541
[drumming]

460
00:26:25,375 --> 00:26:27,002
[speaker] Woo-hoo!

461
00:26:28,295 --> 00:26:30,505
If we wanna, we can add [bleep]
to, like, the verse.

462
00:26:30,589 --> 00:26:31,715
Like, just layer it a little bit?

463
00:26:31,798 --> 00:26:33,466
