472
00:26:56,823 --> 00:26:58,366
And I remember I looked at him.
I was like,

473
00:26:58,450 --> 00:27:01,453
"Well, f-fuck, dude, that's, like,
kind of your job." [laughs]

474
00:27:01,536 --> 00:27:04,372
<i>♪ I took her out, it was a Friday night ♪</i>

475
00:27:04,456 --> 00:27:05,457
<i>♪ I wore cologne... ♪</i>

476
00:27:05,540 --> 00:27:07,334
