and something clicked.

478
00:27:10,837 --> 00:27:13,006
<i>And then he just opened up the valve.</i>

479
00:27:13,089 --> 00:27:16,593
<i>♪ And that's about the time</i>
<i>she walked away from me ♪</i>

480
00:27:16,676 --> 00:27:19,429
<i>♪ Nobody likes you when you're 23 ♪</i>

481
00:27:19,512 --> 00:27:22,223
