482
00:27:22,307 --> 00:27:23,767
<i>♪ What the hell is ADD? ♪</i>

483
00:27:23,850 --> 00:27:25,518
<i>♪ My friends say I should act my age ♪</i>

484
00:27:25,602 --> 00:27:27,312
<i>♪ What's my age again? ♪</i>

485
00:27:27,395 --> 00:27:29,397
<i>♪ What's my age again? ♪</i>

486
00:27:32,067 --> 00:27:33,693
[Tom] <i>We had a meeting</i>
<i>at the record label,</i>

487
00:27:33,777 --> 00:27:35,695
<i>and the president of the label says,</i>

488
00:27:35,779 --> 00:27:37,530
<i>"You need to prepare for three things:</i>

489
00:27:38,323 --> 00:27:39,866
<i>"you're gonna be bigger</i>
<i>than you ever thought.</i>

490
00:27:40,367 --> 00:27:43,119
<i>"You're gonna make more money</i>
<i>than you ever thought.</i>

491
00:27:43,203 --> 00:27:45,246
And you're gonna be more famous
than you ever thought."

492
00:27:46,498 --> 00:27:49,167
And I said,
"This guy's fucking high." [laughs]

493
00:27:49,876 --> 00:27:53,213
<i>♪ And that's about the time</i>
<i>she walked away from me ♪</i>

494
00:27:53,296 --> 00:27:56,257
<i>♪ Nobody likes you when you're 23 ♪</i>

495
00:27:56,341 --> 00:27:58,968
<i>At this point, you know,</i>
<i>we're barely getting out of clubs</i>

496
00:27:59,052 --> 00:28:02,555
where our friends' bands are lighting
drumsticks on fire in their ass.

497
00:28:02,639 --> 00:28:03,723
<i>♪ What's my age again? ♪</i>

498
00:28:03,807 --> 00:28:09,270
<i>♪ What's my age again? ♪</i>

499
00:28:09,354 --> 00:28:11,981
There's nothing about that
that's gonna be in an arena, you know?

500
00:28:12,065 --> 00:28:14,067
Um, but I was wrong.

501
00:28:14,859 --> 00:28:17,904
[♪ "All The Small Things" playing]

502
00:28:22,492 --> 00:28:25,787
<i>♪ All the small things... ♪</i>

503
00:28:25,870 --> 00:28:27,247
[Mark] <i>We started touring that album</i>

504
00:28:27,330 --> 00:28:29,916
and went from, literally,
