Why don't you go back to LA

529
00:29:56,711 --> 00:29:58,713
<i>and go do your thing out there."</i>

530
00:30:00,256 --> 00:30:02,759
<i>I went back to LA soon after that.</i>

531
00:30:02,842 --> 00:30:05,011
<i>And life just kept getting crazier.</i>

532
00:30:06,846 --> 00:30:10,016
