533
00:30:10,099 --> 00:30:14,646
[Tim] <i>I started a side project called</i>
<i>the Transplants with my friend Rob,</i>

534
00:30:14,729 --> 00:30:17,148
{\an8}and Rob was Rancid's roadie.

535
00:30:17,774 --> 00:30:19,234
{\an8}"Security."

536
00:30:19,317 --> 00:30:21,528
<i>But we didn't know really what it was,</i>

537
00:30:21,611 --> 00:30:23,613
<i>and it didn't have a drummer.</i>

538
00:30:23,696 --> 00:30:25,865
{\an8}We were throwing a couple names around,
but we were like,

539
00:30:25,949 --> 00:30:29,577
{\an8}"If we're gonna get one, let's get
the best one that there is," you know?

540
00:30:29,661 --> 00:30:30,703
[crowd cheering]

541
00:30:30,787 --> 00:30:34,165
[Tim] <i>It was all of our band, but Travis,</i>
<i>he was almost like the maestro.</i>

542
00:30:35,166 --> 00:30:37,627
I feel like I won the lottery
of punk rock, man.

543
00:30:37,710 --> 00:30:40,922
{\an8}-[♪ "Tall Cans in the Air" playing]
<i>-♪ Nobody move, nobody get hurt ♪</i>

544
00:30:44,467 --> 00:30:46,678
[Travis] <i>It was drum and bass,</i>
<i>it was punk rock,</i>

545
00:30:46,761 --> 00:30:48,721
<i>it was rap, it was hardcore.</i>

546
00:30:48,805 --> 00:30:49,931
<i>It was everything.</i>

547
00:30:50,014 --> 00:30:52,684
<i>♪ Take a look around, baby,</i>
<i>yeah, my whole... ♪</i>

548
00:30:52,767 --> 00:30:54,394
[Tim] <i>In a lot of ways,</i>
<i>the Transplants were</i>

549
00:30:54,477 --> 00:30:58,773
<i>all of Travis's universes in one band.</i>

550
00:30:58,857 --> 00:31:02,861
<i>-♪ Tall cans in the air, let me see 'em ♪</i>
<i>-♪ Fuck you ♪</i>

551
00:31:02,944 --> 00:31:05,697
<i>The energy of us</i>
<i>playing together was wild.</i>

552
00:31:05,780 --> 00:31:07,240
<i>-♪ ...let me see 'em ♪</i>
<i>-♪ Fuck you ♪</i>

553
00:31:07,323 --> 00:31:10,243
<i>I had friends that were</i>
<i>in punk rock for a long time,</i>

554
00:31:10,326 --> 00:31:14,080
and they were like,
"Damn, the Transplants's pit,

555
00:31:14,163 --> 00:31:16,457
<i>man, that's the wildest pit</i>
<i>I've ever been in."</i>

556
00:31:19,627 --> 00:31:21,588
[crowd cheering]

557
00:31:22,630 --> 00:31:24,549
Me and Rob would go out every night

558
00:31:24,632 --> 00:31:26,843
