561
00:31:33,099 --> 00:31:36,519
[♪ "Gangsters and Thugs" playing]

562
00:31:38,646 --> 00:31:41,858
[Shanna Moakler] <i>I met Travis</i>
<i>at a nightclub called The Standard.</i>

563
00:31:41,941 --> 00:31:43,151
{\an8}I went out with my girlfriend,

564
00:31:43,234 --> 00:31:45,945
