567
00:31:54,454 --> 00:31:57,498
<i>♪ Some of my friends sell drugs... ♪</i>

568
00:31:57,582 --> 00:32:00,877
[Travis] <i>Whatever hot spot there was,</i>
<i>every night, Shanna and I would go out.</i>

569
00:32:04,005 --> 00:32:05,882
I was constantly partying.

570
00:32:11,387 --> 00:32:13,890
You see that little heart there,
beating nicely?

571
00:32:14,891 --> 00:32:18,770
{\an8}[Travis] <i>From the day I found out</i>
<i>Shanna was pregnant with Landon,</i>

572
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:21,856
<i>you could just see</i>
<i>I was trying to make a change.</i>

573
00:32:22,732 --> 00:32:25,568
<i>I started exercising,</i>
<i>which I never did before.</i>

574
00:32:26,444 --> 00:32:30,323
<i>One day, I just left the house</i>
<i>and ran to the freeway and back.</i>

575
00:32:30,406 --> 00:32:34,285
<i>I didn't really know what I was doing,</i>
<i>but I wanted to be healthier.</i>

576
00:32:34,369 --> 00:32:36,204
<i>So that started being my regimen,</i>

577
00:32:36,287 --> 00:32:38,498
<i>run to the freeway and back every day.</i>

578
00:32:39,791 --> 00:32:42,043
<i>I had this burning desire</i>

579
00:32:42,126 --> 00:32:43,753
to become the greatest father I could be.

580
00:32:43,836 --> 00:32:45,630
Good job, bubbies.

581
00:32:45,713 --> 00:32:47,882
-Good boy. Okay, let's walk.
-[whispering] Come on, come on.

582
00:32:47,966 --> 00:32:49,884
[Travis] <i>But I was constantly touring.</i>

583
00:32:51,469 --> 00:32:53,388
